BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ida-2027-deadline-abstract@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART:20261129T105959Z
DTEND:20261129T115959Z
SUMMARY:[Data Mining & Data Science][Machine Learning] IDA 2027 - Abstract 
 submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Symposium on Intelligent Data A
 nalysis\nWebsite: https://ida2027.eu/\nSource URL: https://ida2027.eu/reg
 ular-paper-track/\nLocation: Pisa\, Italy\nTopics: Data Mining & Data Sci
 ence\, Machine Learning\, Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertainty ML\, Time 
 Series & Sequential Data\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-based / interdi
 sciplinary\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-29\nNotes: 
 Official IDA 2027 site confirms the 25th symposium in Pisa\, Apr 21-23\, 
 2027 (venue TBA). Deadlines are labelled AoE\, but the regular-track CFP 
 also says 'All deadlines are 23:59:59 SST'\, read as Samoa time (UTC-11)\
 , so its rows store that earlier -11:00 instant per their cutoff notes\; 
 the PhD Forum page states only AOE (-12:00). The abstract gate follows th
 e abstract-then-paper CMT schedule\, as in 2026\; the page does not expli
 citly call it mandatory.\nCutoff note: CFP lists dates as AOE but says 'A
 ll deadlines are 23:59:59 SST (Anywhere on Earth)'\; SST (Samoa\, UTC-11)
  is 1 h before AoE. Earliest instant stored.
URL:https://ida2027.eu/regular-paper-track/
END:VEVENT
